## Why This Is Asked
Evaluates real-world streaming data engineering with idempotency, data layout, and operational controls in GCP.

## Key Concepts
- Pub/Sub at-least-once vs exactly-once delivery
- Dataflow streaming, insertId with BigQuery
- Cloud Storage lifecycle and partitioned raw data
- IAM, VPC Service Controls, and security boundaries
- Dead-lettering, test plans, and failure scenarios

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo-transform in Dataflow-like style (conceptual)
function transform(msg) {
  const parsed = JSON.parse(msg.data);
  const key = parsed.deviceId + '|' + parsed.sequence;
  if (seenKeys.has(key)) return null; // dedupe
  seenKeys.add(key);
  return enrich(parsed);
}
```

